{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-112745-r4567737","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:White Chocolate Cheesecake","sourcePageId":112745,"sourceRevision":"4567737","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-10-13T13:39:35Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:White%20Chocolate%20Cheesecake&oldid=4567737","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T16:29:22.049Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Baking recipes","Category:Dessert recipes","Category:Easy recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for cheesecake","Category:Recipes using almond","Category:Recipes using almond extract","Category:Recipes using butter","Category:Recipes using cream cheese","Category:Recipes using crumb crust","Category:Recipes using egg","Category:Recipes using granulated sugar","Category:Recipes using wheat flour","Category:Recipes using white chocolate","Category:Recipes with metric units","Category:Recipes without servings"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"31af7d67ade6f285cba6561b26d05c9c00cf82e998c1808a50562eda6e1c3c3f","sourceWikitext":"{{recipesummary\n| category = Cheesecake recipes\n| time = ~46–47 minutes\n| difficulty = 2\n}}\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Dessert|Dessert]]\n__NOTOC__\n'''White chocolate cheesecake''' is a baked [[Cookbook:Cheesecake|cheesecake]] variant.\n== Ingredients ==\n\n=== Crust ===\n\n* 1¼ [[Cookbook:Cup|cups]] [[Cookbook:shortbread|shortbread]] crumbs\n* ¼ cup ground [[Cookbook:Almond|almonds]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoons]] white granulated [[Cookbook:Sugar|sugar]]\n* ⅛ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] almond extract\n* 3 tablespoons melted [[Cookbook:Butter|butter]]\n\n=== Filling ===\n\n* 175 [[Cookbook:Gram|grams]] chopped white [[Cookbook:chocolate|chocolate]]\n* 1.5 [[Cookbook:Kilogram|kilograms]] soft [[Cookbook:Cream Cheese|cream cheese]]\n* 250 grams soft light cream cheese\n* 5 large [[Cookbook:Egg|eggs]], at room temperature\n* ¾ cup white granulated sugar\n* 3 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoons]] [[Cookbook:flour|flour]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:vanilla|vanilla essence]]\n* ¼ teaspoon almond extract\n\n== Procedure ==\n\n# Mix ingredients for the crust (shortbread crumbs, ground almonds, sugar, almond extract, and melted butter) and press into the bottom of a [[Cookbook:Springform Pan|springform pan]].\n# [[Cookbook:Bake|Bake]] at 200°C degrees for 5–6 minutes.\n# Remove from oven and cool.\n# When cool, grease the sides of the pan lightly.\n# Melt and cool the chocolate.\n# Mix together cream cheeses, then add eggs, one at a time.\n# Mix in sugar, flour, vanilla, and almond extract.\n# Stir 1 cup of mixture into the chocolate, then mix all.\n# Pour into the pan and bake at 160°C for 40 minutes.\n\n[[Category:Recipes for cheesecake]]\n[[Category:Recipes with metric units]]\n[[Category:Recipes using white chocolate]]\n[[Category:Baking recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using almond]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Dessert recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using almond extract]]\n[[Category:Recipes using granulated sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cream cheese]]\n[[Category:Recipes using crumb crust]]\n[[Category:Recipes using wheat flour]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"White Ch